      "y": 100,
      "width": 280,
      "height": 150,
      "text": "Leverage: fixed 3×\nVolatility drag: yes (fatal)\nIn chop: melts away\nHorizon: short (days–weeks)\nHolding cost: ~1%/yr + drag\n\n(X) Chop with flat underlying\n     → only TQQQ loses",
